                            Search, Filter & Sort
                        </div>
                        <ul class="guide-list">
                            <li><strong>Search:</strong> Type in the search bar to instantly filter your library.</li>
                            <li><strong>Filters:</strong> Filter by platform, playtime, last played, and more.</li>
                            <li><strong>Grid / List:</strong> Toggle between card grid view and compact list view.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="guide-section">
