                            Surprise Me
                        </div>
                        <ul class="guide-list">
                            <li><strong>Play Mode:</strong> Picks a random game from your installed games and launches it.</li>
                            <li><strong>Install Mode:</strong> Picks a random game you own but haven't installed yet.</li>
                            <li><strong>Custom Pool:</strong> Set a specific list of games for the roulette to pick from.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

