                            Game Library
                        </div>
                        <ul class="guide-list">
                            <li><strong>Auto-Scan:</strong> Baddel automatically detects all your installed games from Steam, Epic, EA, Ubisoft, Riot, Rockstar, and Discord.</li>
                            <li><strong>Two Views:</strong> Switch between <em>All Games</em> (everything you own) and <em>Installed Games</em> (ready to play).</li>
                            <li><strong>Manual Add:</strong> Use the "+ Add Game" button to add any game not detected automatically.</li>
                        </ul>
