                            Search, Filter & Sort
                        </div>
                        <ul class="guide-list">
                            <li><strong>Search:</strong> Type in the search bar to instantly filter your library.</li>
                            <li><strong>Filters:</strong> Filter by platform, playtime, last played, and more.</li>
                            <li><strong>Grid / List:</strong> Toggle between card grid view and compact list view.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="guide-section">
                        <div class="guide-section-title">
                            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 3 21 3 21 8"/><line x1="4" y1="20" x2="21" y2="3"/><polyline points="21 16 21 21 16 21"/><line x1="15" y1="15" x2="21" y2="21"/></svg>
                            Surprise Me
                        </div>
                        <ul class="guide-list">
                            <li><strong>Play Mode:</strong> Picks a random game from your installed games and launches it.</li>
                            <li><strong>Install Mode:</strong> Picks a random game you own but haven't installed yet.</li>
                            <li><strong>Custom Pool:</strong> Set a specific list of games for the roulette to pick from.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="guide-section">
                        <div class="guide-section-title">
