//                    → verified in ROULETTE_JS full text
//   Section 19     : roulette section boundary integrity in ROULETTE_JS
//   Section 20     : script-order in dashboard.html
//   Section 21     : window exports from roulette.js
//   Section 22     : app.js displacement guard (moved code is gone)
//   Section 23     : hygiene — no Arabic / emoji / mojibake in roulette.js
